-label pi-secondary-font\">HP</h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">16</div>\n</div><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Resistances <sup><a href=\"/wiki/Resistances\" title=\"Resistances\">(info)</a></sup></h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"resistances\" data-item-name=\"resistances\">\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><ul><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Resistant to Non-Magical Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Bludgeoning_Resistance_NM.png/28px-Bludgeoning_Resistance_NM.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Bludgeoning_Resistance_NM.png/42px-Bludgeoning_Resistance_NM.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Bludgeoning_Resistance_NM.png/56px-Bludgeoning_Resistance_NM.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Resistant to Non-Magical Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Bludgeoning_Resistance_NM.png/28px-Bludgeoning_Resistance_NM.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Bludgeoning_Resistance_NM.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></li><li><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Resistant to Non-Magical Slashing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Slashing_Resistance_NM.png/28px-Slashing_Resistance_NM.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Slashing_Resistance_NM.png/42px-Slashing_Resistance_NM.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Slashing_Resistance_NM.png/56px-Slashing_Resistance_NM.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Resistant to Non-Magical Slashing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Slashing_Resistance_NM.png/28px-Slashing_Resistance_NM.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"42\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/20/Slashing_Resistance_NM.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image li